    <div class="qa rv" style="--d: 150ms" id="faq-tabs-template--23927395876979__group_faq_WdDQnK-qa">


      

      <div class="faq-group" data-g="skin-concern" id="faq-tabs-template--23927395876979__group_faq_WdDQnK-group-skin-concern" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="faq-tabs-template--23927395876979__group_faq_WdDQnK-tab-skin-concern">

        

          

          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Why 75 days?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>Skin turns over roughly every 28 days, so 75 days is about three turnovers. That is how long a change takes to hold instead of sitting on the surface and washing off.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                When will I see results?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>Lesion count was down 26.2% at two weeks and 47.7% at four in our clinical study.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Can I use it on active breakouts?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>Yes, over the whole area rather than dabbed on spots. It is a daily serum, not a spot treatment.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          

        

      </div>


      

      <div class="faq-group" data-g="skin-type" id="faq-tabs-template--23927395876979__group_faq_WdDQnK-group-skin-type" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="faq-tabs-template--23927395876979__group_faq_WdDQnK-tab-skin-type" style="display:none;">

        

          

          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Is it safe for sensitive skin?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>It has cica and a five-ceramide barrier system alongside the acids. It does still contain acids, so patch test first and start every other night if your skin reacts easily.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Is it suitable for Indian skin?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>Yes. Fitzpatrick IV to VI skin marks more easily after inflammation, so the formula leaves out the actives most likely to cause that.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                I’m 24. Am I too young to start?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>No. At 24 you are protecting structure rather than trying to repair it later, which is the easier job.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Can I use it during pregnancy?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>It contains salicylic acid. Check with your doctor if you are pregnant or breastfeeding.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          

        

      </div>


      

      <div class="faq-group" data-g="formula-basics" id="faq-tabs-template--23927395876979__group_faq_WdDQnK-group-formula-basics" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="faq-tabs-template--23927395876979__group_faq_WdDQnK-tab-formula-basics" style="display:none;">

        

          

          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Which size should I start with?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p><strong>10 ml</strong> is about 15 days, enough to see how your skin takes it. <strong>30 ml</strong> is about 40 days. <strong>Two 30 ml bottles</strong> is the full 75-day protocol.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Can I use it with my existing routine?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>Yes. After cleansing, before moisturiser, no change to your SPF. If you are on tretinoin or clindamycin, ask your dermatologist before adding anything new.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                What is the conditioned media?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>Growth factors and signalling proteins from adipose-derived stem cells, first used in clinical aesthetics in South Korea. The cells are not in the serum, only the proteins they produce.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Do you use proven actives like niacinamide?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>Yes. Niacinamide is in there for oil and tone, alongside the conditioned media and marine biotic factors.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Where is it manufactured?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>In India, in a GMP-certified facility. Actives are sourced from South Korea, France, Belgium, Spain, Germany and the USA.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          

        

      </div>


      

      <div class="faq-group" data-g="shipping" id="faq-tabs-template--23927395876979__group_faq_WdDQnK-group-shipping" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="faq-tabs-template--23927395876979__group_faq_WdDQnK-tab-shipping" style="display:none;">

        

          

          
            <details>
              <summary>
                When will it arrive?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>Dispatched within 2 to 3 business days. After that, metro deliveries usually take 3 to 5 business days and other regions 5 to 7. Tracking comes by WhatsApp and email when it ships.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                What if I miss the delivery?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>The courier tries three times, and you get a WhatsApp message so you can pick a better time. After three attempts the parcel returns to us and reshipping costs ₹100. If it shows as delivered but has not reached you, write to us within 48 hours.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Can I return the serum if it doesn’t work for me?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>Unopened products within 7 days of delivery. Once opened we cannot take it back. If it arrived damaged or wrong, email care@aesthex.in within 48 hours with a photo.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Can I change or cancel my order?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>Not once it is confirmed. The address and the delivery option lock in at that point. Email care@aesthex.in with your order number and we will tell you what is possible.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          


          
            <details>
              <summary>
                Why don’t you ever discount?
              </summary>

              <div class="in">
                <p>We do not run sales. The price is the same all year, so there is nothing to wait for.</p>
              </div>
            </details>
          

        

